AIC8800 USB driver imported from:
https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800

Source commit: 6e076049b719ac2ff7ce5c92786a680407b11cdb
Upstream release: 5.0+git20260123.5f7be68d-7

PowerFin enables the firmware loader and fullmac driver as modules. Firmware
for USB ID a69c:8d80 is installed by the Buildroot aic8800-firmware package.
